  mod_import_err_transitive.pcpp - break step of mod_import.pcpp: imports are
  not transitive. This file imports mod_import_b only; mod_import_b imports
  mod_import_a, but that does not make mod_import_a this file's import.

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\mod_import_err_transitive.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\mod_import_err_transitive.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe mod_import_err_transitive;
